%% What happens between the menu item and the picture appearing in the tree.
%% This file is a .mermaid rather than a .mmd, which is the other extension the
%% editor draws — the same pane, the same menu, a different suffix.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant Pane as Preview pane
    participant Export as DiagramExport
    participant Web as The web view
    You->>Pane: Export, PNG
    Pane->>Export: the text on screen, and this file's name
    Export->>Export: is export.png ours to overwrite?
    alt somebody else's picture is already there
        Export-->>Pane: nothing written, and which file stopped it
        Pane-->>You: one sentence, no picture
    else ours, or nothing there at all
        Export->>Web: render the diagram
        Web-->>Export: an SVG with its own size
        Export->>Web: rasterise it at twice the size
        Web-->>Export: the bytes of a PNG
        Export->>Export: stamp it, so the next export may replace it
        Export-->>Pane: export.png
        Pane-->>You: a toast, and the file selected in the tree
    end
